{"result":"{
  "id": "19400",
  "key": "SFCC-847",
  "summary": "drawer/content/filters",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/19400",
  "description": "As a Developer, I want a drawer/content/filters component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, so that shoppers can view, select, and apply product filters from a slide-out drawer on PLP and search results pages.\n\n----\n\nThe component covers the panel content only — the drawer shell, slide-in behaviour, overlay, and close trigger are owned by drawer (SFCC-736). This component renders as children passed into that shell. The filter facet content rendered inside each accordion (radio buttons, colour swatches, size options etc.) is covered in SFCC-108.\n\nThe component composes the following sub-components:\n\n- drawer/filters — the filter panel rendered inside the drawer; supports multiple variants corresponding to each filter facet group\n- Accordion — one instance per filter facet group; supports expanded and collapsed states\n- Button-group — renders the CLEAR (Secondary) and APPLY (Primary) buttons at the bottom of the drawer; layout=Inline\n\ndrawer/filters variants in scope:\n\n|Variant|Notes|\n|---|---|\n|Category - PLP (All)|Shows all top-level category options as radio buttons|\n|Category - PLP (Dresses)|Shows Dresses sub-category options as radio buttons|\n|Selected|Shows chosen value as a chip/tag, replacing the options list|\n|Colour|Colour filter facet — stacked checkbox-group with swatches|\n|Size|Size filter facet — three sub-groups: Clothing, Accessories, Shoes|\n|Availability|Two checkbox options: Available, Coming Soon|\n|Material|Material filter facet — stacked checkbox-group|\n|Sleeve Length|Sleeve length filter facet — stacked checkbox-group|\n\ndrawer/content props (Filters tab):\n\n|Prop|Values|Notes|\n|---|---|---|\n|size|Large|Controls overall size of the drawer content|\n|tab|Filters|Scoped to Filters tab only for this story|\n|variant|Default|Default variant|\n\nAccordion props:\n\n|Prop|Values|Notes|\n|---|---|---|\n|state|Default|Interaction state|\n|variant|Expanded, Collapsed|Controls whether the facet group is open or closed\nOnly one accordion can be expanded at a time. Expanding a new accordion collapses the previously expanded one.|\n|content|Filters|Content type rendered inside the accordion|\n|label|Category, Colour, Size, Material, Sleeve Length, Availability|The filter group label displayed in the accordion header|\n\nButton-group props:\n\n|Prop|Values|Notes|\n|---|---|---|\n|layout|Inline|Renders CLEAR and APPLY side by side|\n\nButton props:\n\n|Prop|Values|Notes|\n|---|---|---|\n|size|Large| |\n|state|Default| |\n|variant|Secondary (CLEAR), Primary (APPLY)|Two button instances|",
  "status": {
    "name": "Tech design",
    "category": "To Do",
    "color": "blue-gray"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  },
  "priority": {
    "name": "Medium"
  },
  "assignee": {
    "display_name": "Bianca Morley",
    "name": "Bianca Morley",
    "email": "bianca.morley@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3ed5cb479d913eb2e6c6e873c040c0d5?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-4.png"
  },
  "reporter": {
    "display_name": "Bianca Morley",
    "name": "Bianca Morley",
    "email": "bianca.morley@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3ed5cb479d913eb2e6c6e873c040c0d5?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-4.png"
  },
  "labels": [
    "Custom",
    "Squad-B"
  ],
  "created": "2026-08-31T11:46:34.578+1000",
  "updated": "2026-09-16T11:12:55.398+1000",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "14508",
      "body": "Hey User:623a4c25562ab90069f7e510 , do we have a design for the other accordions such as Material and Sleeve Length?\n\n[https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=40003890-151730&t=aGPnsuPyCGTxbCbl-1](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-08T16:46:45.942+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-08T16:46:45.942+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14510",
      "body": "User:712020:95338d1d-c86b-4b96-9d93-2435154f753f  here are some clarifications on this story:\n1. AC2 and AC3 - Do we have a different product attribute for PDP All and PDP Dresses?\n2. AC4 and AC5 are already trying to validate the functionality when an option is selected, should that be part of SFCC-108?\n3. AC9-AC11 - This already describes the functionality of the buttons. Do we need to test it in this story or in SFCC-108?\n4. Do the accordions need to be expanded one at a time?\n5. When do the select variant displayed? Upon selection or when the user expands another accordion?\n6. The other accordions designs are not described on this story; shall we include those?\n7. On the size accordion, do all the button group for Clothing, Accessories and Shoes displayed when expanded?",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-08T17:03:27.349+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-08T17:52:12.559+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14522",
      "body": "User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac \n\nHi Hazel, thanks for flagging these - I've gone through the Figma component playground and here are my answers:\n\n1. **AC2 & AC3 (Category PLP All vs Dresses)** - same Accordion component, same attribute, different options rendered based on context. Not a different product attribute. No AC change needed here.\n1. **AC4 & AC5** - agree these should move to SFCC-108 as they're about facet content rendering. I'll remove them from this story and flag for SFCC-108.\n1. **AC9–AC11 (CLEAR/APPLY)** - AC9 and AC10 (behaviour on click) depend on filter state so agree these belong in SFCC-108. AC11 (button rendering) stays here.\n1. **Accordions - one expanded at a time** - confirmed with Hannah, only one accordion can be expanded at a time.\n1. **Selected variant** - confirmed in the component playground. Selected is a proper filters variant (not just a state) that renders the chosen value as a chip/tag within the expanded accordion, replacing the options list.\n1. **Other accordion designs** - all variants are covered: Category PLP (All), Category PLP (Dresses), Selected, Colour, Size, Availability, Material, Sleeve Length. Nothing missing from the component that I can find.\n1. **Size accordion** - confirmed in the playground. When expanded, all three size groups render: Clothing (0P–4), Accessories (S, M, L, One Size), Shoes (36–41).",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Bianca Morley",
        "name": "Bianca Morley",
        "email": "bianca.morley@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3ed5cb479d913eb2e6c6e873c040c0d5?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-09T09:16:44.296+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-09T09:16:44.296+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14524",
      "body": "User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac Hey! This is Hannah’s comp, so will add it to her to-do’s",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Kiera Rikard-Bell",
        "name": "Kiera Rikard-Bell",
        "email": "kiera.rikard-bell@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f5a85438e9e7b1d7bdfd0f2eb22a4b4e?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FKR-1.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-09T11:00:01.263+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-09T11:00:01.263+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14528",
      "body": "User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac Designs are done. See [here](https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=3216-7913&t=AQ8C1GWGOcotuUL2-1)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Kiera Rikard-Bell",
        "name": "Kiera Rikard-Bell",
        "email": "kiera.rikard-bell@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f5a85438e9e7b1d7bdfd0f2eb22a4b4e?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FKR-1.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-09T12:08:09.131+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-09T12:08:09.131+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14755",
