{
  "id": "19400",
  "key": "SFCC-847",
  "summary": "drawer/content/filters",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/19400",
  "description": "As a Developer, I want a drawer/content/filters component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, so that shoppers can view, select, and apply product filters from a slide-out drawer on PLP and search results pages.\n\n----\n\nThe component covers the panel content only — the drawer shell, slide-in behaviour, overlay, and close trigger are owned by drawer (SFCC-736). This component renders as children passed into that shell. The filter facet content rendered inside each accordion (radio buttons, colour swatches, size options etc.) is covered in SFCC-108.\n\nThe component composes the following sub-components:\n\n- drawer/filters — the filter panel rendered inside the drawer; supports multiple variants corresponding to each filter facet group\n- Accordion — one instance per filter facet group; supports expanded and collapsed states\n- Button-group — renders the CLEAR (Secondary) and APPLY (Primary) buttons at the bottom of the drawer; layout=Inline\n\ndrawer/filters variants in scope:\n\n|Variant|Notes|\n|---|---|\n|Category - PLP (All)|Shows all top-level category options as radio buttons|\n|Category - PLP (Dresses)|Shows Dresses sub-category options as radio buttons|\n|Selected|Shows chosen value as a chip/tag, replacing the options list|\n|Colour|Colour filter facet — stacked checkbox-group with swatches|\n|Size|Size filter facet — three sub-groups: Clothing, Accessories, Shoes|\n|Availability|Two checkbox options: Available, Coming Soon|\n|Material|Material filter facet — stacked checkbox-group|\n|Sleeve Length|Sleeve length filter facet — stacked checkbox-group|\n\ndrawer/content props (Filters tab):\n\n|Prop|Values|Notes|\n|---|---|---|\n|size|Large|Controls overall size of the drawer content|\n|tab|Filters|Scoped to Filters tab only for this story|\n|variant|Default|Default variant|\n\nAccordion props:\n\n|Prop|Values|Notes|\n|---|---|---|\n|state|Default|Interaction state|\n|variant|Expanded, Collapsed|Controls whether the facet group is open or closed\nOnly one accordion can be expanded at a time. Expanding a new accordion collapses the previously expanded one.|\n|content|Filters|Content type rendered inside the accordion|\n|label|Category, Colour, Size, Material, Sleeve Length, Availability|The filter group label displayed in the accordion header|\n\nButton-group props:\n\n|Prop|Values|Notes|\n|---|---|---|\n|layout|Inline|Renders CLEAR and APPLY side by side|\n\nButton props:\n\n|Prop|Values|Notes|\n|---|---|---|\n|size|Large| |\n|state|Default| |\n|variant|Secondary (CLEAR), Primary (APPLY)|Two button instances|",
  "status": {
    "name": "Tech design",
    "category": "To Do",
    "color": "blue-gray"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  },
