      "id": "14508",
      "body": "Hey User:623a4c25562ab90069f7e510 , do we have a design for the other accordions such as Material and Sleeve Length?\n\n[https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=40003890-151730&t=aGPnsuPyCGTxbCbl-1](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-08T16:46:45.942+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-08T16:46:45.942+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14510",
      "body": "User:712020:95338d1d-c86b-4b96-9d93-2435154f753f  here are some clarifications on this story:\n1. AC2 and AC3 - Do we have a different product attribute for PDP All and PDP Dresses?\n2. AC4 and AC5 are already trying to validate the functionality when an option is selected, should that be part of SFCC-108?\n3. AC9-AC11 - This already describes the functionality of the buttons. Do we need to test it in this story or in SFCC-108?\n4. Do the accordions need to be expanded one at a time?\n5. When do the select variant displayed? Upon selection or when the user expands another accordion?\n6. The other accordions designs are not described on this story; shall we include those?\n7. On the size accordion, do all the button group for Clothing, Accessories and Shoes displayed when expanded?",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
