    {
      "id": "14522",
      "body": "User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac \n\nHi Hazel, thanks for flagging these - I've gone through the Figma component playground and here are my answers:\n\n1. **AC2 & AC3 (Category PLP All vs Dresses)** - same Accordion component, same attribute, different options rendered based on context. Not a different product attribute. No AC change needed here.\n1. **AC4 & AC5** - agree these should move to SFCC-108 as they're about facet content rendering. I'll remove them from this story and flag for SFCC-108.\n1. **AC9–AC11 (CLEAR/APPLY)** - AC9 and AC10 (behaviour on click) depend on filter state so agree these belong in SFCC-108. AC11 (button rendering) stays here.\n1. **Accordions - one expanded at a time** - confirmed with Hannah, only one accordion can be expanded at a time.\n1. **Selected variant** - confirmed in the component playground. Selected is a proper filters variant (not just a state) that renders the chosen value as a chip/tag within the expanded accordion, replacing the options list.\n1. **Other accordion designs** - all variants are covered: Category PLP (All), Category PLP (Dresses), Selected, Colour, Size, Availability, Material, Sleeve Length. Nothing missing from the component that I can find.\n1. **Size accordion** - confirmed in the playground. When expanded, all three size groups render: Clothing (0P–4), Accessories (S, M, L, One Size), Shoes (36–41).",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Bianca Morley",
        "name": "Bianca Morley",
        "email": "bianca.morley@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3ed5cb479d913eb2e6c6e873c040c0d5?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-09T09:16:44.296+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-09T09:16:44.296+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14524",
      "body": "User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac Hey! This is Hannah’s comp, so will add it to her to-do’s",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Kiera Rikard-Bell",
        "name": "Kiera Rikard-Bell",
        "email": "kiera.rikard-bell@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f5a85438e9e7b1d7bdfd0f2eb22a4b4e?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FKR-1.png"
