content.content:
{"result":"{
  "id": "18166",
  "key": "SFCC-104",
  "summary": "Filters & Facets — BM Configuration (Shared)",
  "description": "**As a** Site Merchandiser,\n**I want** faceted navigation configured in Business Manager,\n**so that** the correct global and category-level facets, colour swatches, availability filter, and custom filter groups are available for the PWA filter panel to consume.\n\n----\n\nThis story covers the BM configuration side of faceted navigation only. It includes global and category-level facet setup, colour swatch configuration via hex code or swatch image, print and pattern values within the colour facet, availability filter configuration, manual product rank configuration, and custom filter group creation. The PWA build is covered in Search – Filters & Facets — PWA Filter Panel. Depends on SFCC-103 — refinable attributes must be configured in the search index before facets can be set up in BM.\n\n## **Filterable**\n\n- Category\n- Colour\n- Size (clothing, accessories, shoes)\n- Material\n- Sleeve Length\n- Availability",
  "status": {
    "name": "Code Review",
    "category": "In Progress",
    "color": "yellow"
  }
}"}

